  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Technical Assistance for the Substations Reliability Enhancement Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is to provide technical assistance to ensure compliance of procurement processes with the current Ukrainian legislation, the EIB Guide to Procurement and the NPC&#x2019;s &#xab;Ukrenergo&#xbb; internal procedures, contracts budgeting, anti-corruption and technical monitoring of the Substations Reliability Enhancement Programme (SREP) implementation for quality, transparency and efficiency, thus contributing to achieving a high level of integrity, efficiency, energy sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
